set/2085/md_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_DeepL.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2085/lg_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_DeepL.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2085/xl_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_DeepL.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2085/xxl_IVP_PortCo_Logos_520px_032626_DeepL.png",{"id":30,"alt":12,"caption":5,"assetUrl":31,"assetUrlXs":32,"assetUrlSm":33,"assetUrlMd":34,"assetUrlLg":35,"assetUrlXl":36,"assetUrlXxl":37},"2086","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2086/IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_DeepL.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2086/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_DeepL.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2086/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_DeepL.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2086/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_DeepL.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2086/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_DeepL.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2086/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_DeepL.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2086/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_DeepL.jpg","#102C46",[],{"contentTopicImage":41,"name":50,"slug":51},{"id":42,"alt":12,"caption":5,"assetUrl":43,"assetUrlXs":44,"assetUrlSm":45,"assetUrlMd":46,"assetUrlLg":47,"assetUrlXl":48,"assetUrlXxl":49},"2405","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2405/IVP_jumpGuide_IndustryInsights_042026_Industry_Insight.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2405/xs_IVP_jumpGuide_IndustryInsights_042026_Industry_Insight.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2405/sm_IVP_jumpGuide_IndustryInsights_042026_Industry_Insight.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2405/md_IVP_jumpGuide_IndustryInsights_042026_Industry_Insight.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2405/lg_IVP_jumpGuide_IndustryInsights_042026_Industry_Insight.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2405/xl_IVP_jumpGuide_IndustryInsights_042026_Industry_Insight.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2405/xxl_IVP_jumpGuide_IndustryInsights_042026_Industry_Insight.jpg","Industry Insight","industry-insight",false,"2023-12-07","Worth the Slush | IVP",{"id":56,"alt":12,"caption":5,"assetUrl":57,"assetUrlXs":58,"assetUrlSm":59,"assetUrlMd":60,"assetUrlLg":61,"assetUrlXl":62,"assetUrlXxl":63},"1454","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1454/slush_Social_image_stage.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1454/xs_slush_Social_image_stage.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1454/sm_slush_Social_image_stage.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1454/md_slush_Social_image_stage.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1454/lg_slush_Social_image_stage.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1454/xl_slush_Social_image_stage.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1454/xxl_slush_Social_image_stage.jpg",{"id":65,"alt":12,"caption":12,"assetUrl":5,"assetUrlXs":5,"assetUrlSm":5,"assetUrlMd":5,"assetUrlLg":5,"assetUrlXl":5,"assetUrlXxl":5},"1456",[67,79,83,94,97,108,111,122,125,136,139,151,163],{"instance":68},{"__typename":69,"heading":12,"image":70},"FullImage",{"id":71,"alt":12,"caption":12,"assetUrl":72,"assetUrlXs":73,"assetUrlSm":74,"assetUrlMd":75,"assetUrlLg":76,"assetUrlXl":77,"assetUrlXxl":78},"1457","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1457/Outside_Slush__1_.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1457/xs_Outside_Slush__1_.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1457/sm_Outside_Slush__1_.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1457/md_Outside_Slush__1_.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1457/lg_Outside_Slush__1_.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1457/xl_Outside_Slush__1_.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1457/xxl_Outside_Slush__1_.jpg",{"instance":80},{"__typename":81,"largeHeading":12,"heading":12,"body":82},"TextBlock","Every November, founders, investors, global leaders and reporters flock to frigid Helsinki for Slush. Since we first partnered with Supercell in 2013, we’ve been joining this chilly, student-run event and learned it’s well worth braving the snow and ice to connect over a sauna, dinner or a fireside chat. Having opened up our London office this August, the full team made the relatively short trip up North to connect with many of our favorite people, gathered all in one place.",{"instance":84},{"__typename":69,"heading":12,"image":85},{"id":86,"alt":12,"caption":12,"assetUrl":87,"assetUrlXs":88,"assetUrlSm":89,"assetUrlMd":90,"assetUrlLg":91,"assetUrlXl":92,"assetUrlXxl":93},"1462","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1462/Jarek_On_Stage_for_web.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1462/xs_Jarek_On_Stage_for_web.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1462/sm_Jarek_On_Stage_for_web.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1462/md_Jarek_On_Stage_for_web.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1462/lg_Jarek_On_Stage_for_web.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1462/xl_Jarek_On_Stage_for_web.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1462/xxl_Jarek_On_Stage_for_web.jpg",{"instance":95},{"__typename":81,"largeHeading":12,"heading":12,"body":96},"DeepL’s CEO and founder [Jarek Kutylowski](https://slush.org/speakers/jaroslaw-kutylowski-founder-ceo-of-deepl/) joined IVP’s [Eric Liaw](https://slush.org/speakers/eric-liaw-general-partner-of-ivp/) on the Founder Stage to share how DeepL powers its intuitively accurate AI translator, which competes with both Google and old school, manual translation. Here are some things worth remembering and knowing from their talk ([keynote video here](https://youtu.be/peVdmB86Lug)):\r\n",{"instance":98},{"__typename":69,"heading":12,"image":99},{"id":100,"alt":12,"caption":12,"assetUrl":101,"assetUrlXs":102,"assetUrlSm":103,"assetUrlMd":104,"assetUrlLg":105,"assetUrlXl":106,"assetUrlXxl":107},"1461","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1461/Audience_pic__1_.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1461/xs_Audience_pic__1_.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1461/sm_Audience_pic__1_.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1461/md_Audience_pic__1_.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1461/lg_Audience_pic__1_.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1461/xl_Audience_pic__1_.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1461/xxl_Audience_pic__1_.jpg",{"instance":109},{"__typename":81,"largeHeading":12,"heading":12,"body":110},"**Why language is so hard to crack**\r\n\r\nDifferent content requires different levels of accuracy and fluency. For instance, a technical document depends on a more straightforward, precise translation whereas marketing text needs to flow as if you were having a casual conversation with a friend - getting the gist, [comprendo](https://www.deepl.com/translator?share=generic#es/en/comprendo%7CI%20get%20it) - not stiff and robotic.\r\n\r\nDeepL spent years getting the training data and neural architectures right, for different situations. Other LLMs include an internet’s worth of data, while DeepL’s neural network is specially trained for translation and language.",{"instance":112},{"__typename":69,"heading":12,"image":113},{"id":114,"alt":12,"caption":12,"assetUrl":115,"assetUrlXs":116,"assetUrlSm":117,"assetUrlMd":118,"assetUrlLg":119,"assetUrlXl":120,"assetUrlXxl":121},"1469","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1469/Eric_on_big_screen.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1469/xs_Eric_on_big_screen.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1469/sm_Eric_on_big_screen.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1469/md_Eric_on_big_screen.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1469/lg_Eric_on_big_screen.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1469/xl_Eric_on_big_screen.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1469/xxl_Eric_on_big_screen.jpg",{"instance":123},{"__typename":81,"largeHeading":12,"heading":12,"body":124},"**Great ideas can come from anywhere and anyone, and many companies are best conceived and built in Europe**\r\n\r\nLanguage beguiled Jarek since his family moved from Poland to Germany when he was a teen, knowing fast kein Deutsch. He realized how tricky - and important - languages are.\r\n\r\nHe applied his computer science and mathematics education to reframe the challenge of translation, leveraging breakthrough neural networks and deep learning to create AI-powered translation. DeepL helps solve this huge problem for people around the globe. ",{"instance":126},{"__typename":69,"heading":12,"image":127},{"id":128,"alt":12,"caption":12,"assetUrl":129,"assetUrlXs":130,"assetUrlSm":131,"assetUrlMd":132,"assetUrlLg":133,"assetUrlXl":134,"assetUrlXxl":135},"1470","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1470/eric_and_jarek_onstage.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1470/xs_eric_and_jarek_onstage.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1470/sm_eric_and_jarek_onstage.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1470/md_eric_and_jarek_onstage.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1470/lg_eric_and_jarek_onstage.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1470/xl_eric_and_jarek_onstage.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1470/xxl_eric_and_jarek_onstage.jpg",{"instance":137},{"__typename":81,"largeHeading":12,"heading":12,"body":138},"**Don’t build your own LLM unless it is essential to your business**\r\n\r\nThere were no transformers in 2016, so DeepL had to build its own LLM from scratch. This decision established DeepL’s technological foundation, which is the best language model for translation. On the other hand, if your product doesn’t depend on a differentiated LLM, better to adopt models off the shelf.\r\n\r\nThere’s too much to capture from our time on the ground so take a look behind the scenes with our team. \r\n\r\nKiitos ja nähdään ensi vuonna!",{"instance":140},{"__typename":69,"heading":12,"image":141},{"id":142,"alt":12,"caption":143,"assetUrl":144,"assetUrlXs":145,"assetUrlSm":146,"assetUrlMd":147,"assetUrlLg":148,"assetUrlXl":149,"assetUrlXxl":150},"1465","Eric and Earlybird’s Paul Klemm at our ecosystem dinner","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1465/Eric_at_Earlybird_dinner_USE_THIS.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1465/xs_Eric_at_Earlybird_dinner_USE_THIS.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1465/sm_Eric_at_Earlybird_dinner_USE_THIS.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1465/md_Eric_at_Earlybird_dinner_USE_THIS.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1465/lg_Eric_at_Earlybird_dinner_USE_THIS.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1465/xl_Eric_at_Earlybird_dinner_USE_THIS.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1465/xxl_Eric_at_Earlybird_dinner_USE_THIS.jpg",{"instance":152},{"__typename":69,"heading":12,"image":153},{"id":154,"alt":12,"caption":155,"assetUrl":156,"assetUrlXs":157,"assetUrlSm":158,"assetUrlMd":159,"assetUrlLg":160,"assetUrlXl":161,"assetUrlXxl":162},"1467","Superhuman CEO and founder Rahul Vohra sharing brand strategy advice to a standing-room-only crowd","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1467/Rahul_on_stage_USE_THIS.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1467/xs_Rahul_on_stage_USE_THIS.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1467/sm_Rahul_on_stage_USE_THIS.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1467/md_Rahul_on_stage_USE_THIS.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1467/lg_Rahul_on_stage_USE_THIS.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1467/xl_Rahul_on_stage_USE_THIS.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1467/xxl_Rahul_on_stage_USE_THIS.jpg",{"instance":164},{"__typename":69,"heading":12,"image":165},{"id":166,"alt":12,"caption":167,"assetUrl":168,"assetUrlXs":169,"assetUrlSm":170,"assetUrlMd":171,"assetUrlLg":172,"assetUrlXl":173,"assetUrlXxl":174},"1468","Left: Eric with US Ambassador to Finland Douglas Hickey | Right: Team IVP (minus Alex!)","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1468/selfies_pics.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1468/xs_selfies_pics.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1468/sm_selfies_pics.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1468/md_selfies_pics.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1468/lg_selfies_pics.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1468/xl_selfies_pics.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1468/xxl_selfies_pics.jpg",{"id":176,"assetUrl":5},"372",{"assetUrl":5},[],"worth-the-slush",[181,208,241],{"fullName":182,"teamSubcategories":183,"slug":194,"image":195,"abbreviatedTitle":204,"focusAreas":205,"emailAddress":206,"bio":207},"Alex Lim",[184,190],{"name":185,"slug":186,"teamCategory":187},"Consumer","consumer",{"name":188,"slug":189},"Investors","investors",{"name":191,"slug":192,"teamCategory":193},"Fintech & Crypto","fintech-crypto",{"name":188,"slug":189},"alex-lim",{"id":196,"alt":12,"caption":5,"assetUrl":197,"assetUrlXs":198,"assetUrlSm":199,"assetUrlMd":200,"assetUrlLg":201,"assetUrlXl":202,"assetUrlXxl":203},"2335","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2335/IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Alex_Lim.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2335/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Alex_Lim.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2335/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Alex_Lim.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2335/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Alex_Lim.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2335/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Alex_Lim.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2335/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Alex_Lim.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2335/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_A_Alex_Lim.jpg","General Partner ","Consumer, Collaboration, Automation and Applied AI","alim@ivp.com","I moved to San Francisco, sight unseen, after reading the Facebook S-1. My freshman class was one of the first to use Facebook, and I could hardly believe the scale and impact of the business Facebook had seemingly built overnight. After living in London, New York, Singapore and Sydney, I was fascinated to discover what made Silicon Valley the world’s best environment for empowering entrepreneurs.\r\n\r\nAfter almost a decade in San Francisco, I was inspired to bring the Valley mentality to my native UK, and to the rest of Europe. We set up IVP London to accelerate European entrepreneurs’ global ambitions.\r\n\r\nI’ve been lucky to work closely with category-defining founders at companies like Discord, Hims & Hers, and UiPath. These experiences guided my personal approach to working with entrepreneurs: Listen hard, challenge when necessary, and be authentic, no matter what.",{"fullName":209,"teamSubcategories":210,"slug":227,"image":228,"abbreviatedTitle":237,"focusAreas":238,"emailAddress":239,"bio":240},"Eric Liaw",[211,215,219,221,225],{"name":212,"slug":213,"teamCategory":214},"All","investors-all",{"name":188,"slug":189},{"name":216,"slug":217,"teamCategory":218},"Apps","apps",{"name":188,"slug":189},{"name":185,"slug":186,"teamCategory":220},{"name":188,"slug":189},{"name":222,"slug":223,"teamCategory":224},"Digital Health","digital-health",{"name":188,"slug":189},{"name":191,"slug":192,"teamCategory":226},{"name":188,"slug":189},"eric-liaw",{"id":229,"alt":12,"caption":5,"assetUrl":230,"assetUrlXs":231,"assetUrlSm":232,"assetUrlMd":233,"assetUrlLg":234,"assetUrlXl":235,"assetUrlXxl":236},"2353","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2353/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_B_Eric_Liaw.jpg","General Partner","Enterprise Software, Gaming & AR2, Bottom-Up Solutions, Consumer, FinTech","eliaw@ivp.com","I came to IVP not only for what we do but how we do it. We partner with entrepreneurs right as they approach an inflection point—the moment when identifying and equipping an organization with the right ingredients can make an astronomical difference in its trajectory. Together, we’re able to shape the future of high-growth startups and, as a result, the future of our world.\r\n\r\nIt’s a true privilege to work with entrepreneurs and founders who are pushing the envelope to solve pressing issues that serve their customers. Supporting those founders with hard work is its own reward. My commitment to entrepreneurs is to be available whenever they need me.",{"fullName":242,"teamSubcategories":243,"slug":248,"image":249,"abbreviatedTitle":258,"focusAreas":259,"emailAddress":260,"bio":261},"Shreyas Garg",[244,246],{"name":185,"slug":186,"teamCategory":245},{"name":188,"slug":189},{"name":191,"slug":192,"teamCategory":247},{"name":188,"slug":189},"shreyas-garg",{"id":250,"alt":12,"caption":5,"assetUrl":251,"assetUrlXs":252,"assetUrlSm":253,"assetUrlMd":254,"assetUrlLg":255,"assetUrlXl":256,"assetUrlXxl":257},"2388","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2388/IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Shreyas_Garg.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2388/xs_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Shreyas_Garg.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2388/sm_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Shreyas_Garg.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2388/md_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Shreyas_Garg.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2388/lg_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Shreyas_Garg.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2388/xl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Shreyas_Garg.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2388/xxl_IVP_Headshots_1090px_D_Shreyas_Garg.jpg","Partner","SaaS, Consumer, Fintech","sgarg@ivp.com","I wrote my first line of code at 14. It started with spending a few hours teaching a robot named Karel to navigate a screen, but quickly escalated to thousands of hours where I built an AI that beat me at board games, trained a neural net in high school, and even launched a Twitter clone on crypto rails (it raised a bit of funding before it shut it down).\r\n\r\nI studied computer science for eight years and spent every college summer in the Bay Area, eventually moving to San Francisco right after graduation. For as long as I can remember, it’s been clear to me that few things shape the world more profoundly than technology.\r\n\r\nVenture has always felt like a dream job. I love meeting exceptional founders, wherever they are, and supporting them on the journey of solving ambitious problems. I helped launch our London office in 2023, and took nearly 150 flights during that time to connect with entrepreneurs around the globe.\r\n\r\nI'm a generalist at heart. I believe technology can reshape every aspect of society, and I love hearing the creative solutions founders come up with to impact the world in ways I could never have imagined on my own.",{"id":263,"alt":12,"caption":5,"assetUrl":264,"assetUrlXs":265,"assetUrlSm":266,"assetUrlMd":267,"assetUrlLg":268,"assetUrlXl":269,"assetUrlXxl":270},"1455","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1455/Slush_Tile_Image__800_x_880_px_.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1455/xs_Slush_Tile_Image__800_x_880_px_.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1455/sm_Slush_Tile_Image__800_x_880_px_.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1455/md_Slush_Tile_Image__800_x_880_px_.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1455/lg_Slush_Tile_Image__800_x_880_px_.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1455/xl_Slush_Tile_Image__800_x_880_px_.png","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1455/xxl_Slush_Tile_Image__800_x_880_px_.png","Worth the Slush",1790351929208]